#: ../../source/generated/cuda.tile.argmax.rst:2
msgid "cuda.tile.argmax"
msgstr "cuda.tile.argmax"

#: cuda.tile._stub.argmax:1 of
msgid "Performs argmax reduction on tile along the `axis`."
msgstr "沿指定轴对 Tile 执行最大值索引（argmax）归约。"

#: ../../source/generated/cuda.tile.argmax.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: cuda.tile._stub.argmax:3 of
msgid "input tile."
msgstr "输入 Tile。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.argmax:5 of
msgid ""
"the axis for reduction. The default, `axis=None`, will reduce all of the "
"elements. For `argmin` and `argmax`, tuple of axis is not supported."
msgstr "要执行归约的轴。默认值 ``axis=None`` 表示归约所有元素。对于 ``argmin`` 和 ``argmax`` ，不支持传入轴元组。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.argmax:9 of
msgid ""
"If true, preserves the number of dimension from the input tile. "
"propagate_nan (const bool): Float types only. If False (the default), NaN"
" inputs are ignored. If True, NaN propagates: a NaN makes the result NaN "
"for min/max, and argmin/argmax return the index of the first NaN."
msgstr ""
"若为 True，则在输出中保留与输入 Tile 相同的维度数。 ``propagate_nan`` (const "
"bool)：仅适用于浮点类型。若为 False（默认值），则忽略 NaN 输入；若为 True，则传播 NaN：对于 ``min`` / "
"``max`` ，输入中的 NaN 会使结果为 NaN，而 ``argmin`` / ``argmax`` 会返回第一个 NaN 的索引。"

#: ../../source/generated/cuda.tile.argmax.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "返回值"

#: cuda.tile._stub.argmax:14 of
msgid ""
".. rubric:: Examples  Reduce all axes.  .. testcode::     :template: "
"kernel_wrapper.py      tx = ct.arange(8, dtype=ct.int32).reshape((2, 4))"
"     print(\"input:\", tx)     print(\"reduced:\", ct.argmax(tx, None))  "
".. testoutput::      input: [[0, 1, 2, 3], [4, 5, 6, 7]]     reduced: 7  "
"Reduce axis 1 and keepdims.  .. testcode::     :template: "
"kernel_wrapper.py      tx = ct.arange(8, dtype=ct.int32).reshape((2, 4))"
"     print(\"input:\", tx)     print(\"reduced:\", ct.argmax(tx, 1, "
"keepdims=True))  .. testoutput::      input: [[0, 1, 2, 3], [4, 5, 6, 7]]"
"     reduced: [[3], [3]]  If there are ties, the smallest index is "
"returned.  .. testcode::     :template: kernel_wrapper.py      tx = "
"ct.zeros(4, dtype=ct.int32)     tx = ct.cat((tx, tx + 1), axis=0)     "
"print(\"input:\", tx)     print(\"reduced:\", ct.argmax(tx, 0))  .. "
"testoutput::      input: [0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 1]     reduced: 4  Reduce "
"over tuple of axes is not supported for argmax."
msgstr ""

#: cuda.tile._stub.argmax of
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

#: cuda.tile._stub.argmax:16 of
msgid "Reduce all axes."
msgstr "沿所有轴进行归约。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.argmax:30 of
msgid "Reduce axis 1 and keepdims."
msgstr "沿轴 1 进行归约并保留维度（keepdims）。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.argmax:44 of
msgid "If there are ties, the smallest index is returned."
msgstr "若存在多个相同的极值，则返回最小的索引。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.argmax:59 of
msgid "Reduce over tuple of axes is not supported for argmax."
msgstr "``argmax`` 不支持沿轴元组（多个轴）进行归约。"

#: ../../source/generated/cuda.tile.argmax.rst
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "返回类型"

